<h2>5. Opting Out</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to stop receiving SMS.</li>
  <li>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance.</li>
  <li>Uncheck the consent box or remove the phone number in
      <a href="https://sooppiy.com/settings">Account Settings</a> at any time.</li>
</ul>

